  "slug": "wedding-planning-checklist-form",
  "title": "Wedding Planning Checklist Form",
  "subtitle": "Verify wedding readiness by planning horizon, surface blocked decisions, and transfer day-of responsibilities with evidence instead of assumptions.",
  "description": "An original wedding-readiness checklist organized around dated planning gates rather than a generic task list. It captures the approved source records, milestone evidence, responsible owners, exceptions, release decision, and final day-of handoff.",
  "use_case": "Use at formal planning reviews and again before day-of release. Record only completed checks supported by the linked planning record, open an exception for every blocked item, and close when the current plan is released or explicitly held by the responsible event lead.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
    {
